      "choice": "Grouped every 4 consecutive H1 candles to form H4 bars, calculating the 20-period H4 SMA from the last 20 completed H4 bar closes.",
      "reason": "The execution environment provides a single H1 data feed, requiring higher timeframe (H4) data to be synthesized directly within the strategy."
    },
    {
      "topic": "gap_history_warmup",
      "choice": "Require a minimum of 20 recorded historical session gaps before evaluating entry signals.",
      "reason": "The specification requires filtering gap size against the 20-session average gap size."
    },
    {
      "topic": "scenario1_take_profit",
      "choice": "Close Scenario 1 positions when price reaches or crosses the previous session close level.",
      "reason": "Scenario 1 is defined as trading the gap fill, so take-profit occurs upon reaching the pre-gap price level."
    },
    {
      "topic": "scenario2_and_h4_exit",
      "choice": "Close open positions when price crosses the 20-period H4 SMA against the trade direction.",
      "reason": "The timeframe specification states H4 is used to confirm position closure, providing the exit logic for Scenario 2."
    }
  ],
